# Photo pipeline boundaries

Three layers, one gallery upload story (guide avatar and company logo stay separate stacks):

| Layer | Owns |
|-------|------|
| `lib/gallery/` + `components/gallery/` | Client UX, photo-api client, loose-save helpers |
| `lib/image-pipeline/` | Chunk upload sessions, Sharp worker |
| `lib/storage/` | Limits, paths, rate limit, server persist to Storage/DB |

## Rules

1. Route handlers under `app/api/photos/upload/{init,chunk,complete}` stay thin; call into `lib/*` only.
2. Do **not** run Sharp or service-role Storage writes from page components.
3. Do **not** change the init/chunk/complete JSON contract during structure refactors.
4. Gallery page logic belongs in `components/gallery/`; `components/pages/Gallery*` is a thin shell only.
